sional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-jin098-duanpidi-literal","person_id":"7yp_ujo_thl","surname":"段","ming":"匹磾","hao":null,"title":null,"additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p005","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p005:m0071","source_anchor":{"start":71,"end":74,"surface":"段匹磾"},"quote":"昔漢祖以神武革命，開建帝業，繼以文帝之賢，纂承洪緒，清虛玄默，擬跡成康。賈誼歎息，以為天下倒懸，雖言有抑揚，不失事體。今聖朝肇建，漸振宏綱，往段匹磾遣使求效忠節，尚未有勞，便以方州與之。今靳明等為國雪恥，欲除大逆，此之志望，皆欲附翼天飛。雖功大宜報，亦宜有以裁之，當杜漸防萌，慎之在始。中間不逞，互生事變，皆非忠義，率以一朝之榮。天下漸弊，實由於此。春秋之時，天子微弱，諸侯奢侈，晉文思崇周室，至有求隧之請，襄王讓之以禮，聞義而服，自爾諸侯莫敢越度。臣謂前者賊寇未殄，苟以濟事，朝廷諸所加授，頗多爵位兼重。今自臣以下，宜皆除之，且以塞群小矜功之望，夷狄無懨之求。若復遷延，顧望流俗，使奸狡生心，遂相怨謗，指摘朝廷，讒諛蜂起，臣有以知陛下無以正之。此安危之機，天下之望。","status":"source_attested","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","source_id":"s-jinshu098-wangdun-ws2614273-comparison"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"段匹磾","kind":"person","person_id":"7yp_ujo_thl","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：duanpi。","source_identity_role":"duanpi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#duanpi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"匹磾","kind":"person","person_id":"7yp_ujo_thl","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：duanpi。","source_identity_role":"duanpi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#duanpi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"匹磾","kind":"person","person_id":"7yp_ujo_thl","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：duanpi。","source_identity_role":"duanpi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#duanpi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p005:m0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"段匹磾","person_id":"7yp_ujo_thl","kind":"person","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-wangdun-comparison"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011","text":"建興末，隨琨投段匹磾。匹磾自領幽州，取諶為別駕。匹磾既害琨，尋亦敗喪。時南路阻絕，段末波在遼西，諶往投之。元帝之初，末波通使于江左，諶因其使抗表理琨，文旨甚切，於是即加弔祭。累徵諶為散騎中書侍郎，而為末波所留，遂不得南渡。末波死，弟遼代立，諶流離世故且二十載。石季龍破遼西，復為季龍所得，以為中書侍郎、國子祭酒、侍中、中書監。屬冉閔誅石氏，諶隨閔軍，于襄國遇害，時年六十七，是歲永和六年也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":209,"capture_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/received-rendered-capture.json","capture_kind":"existing_rendered_text_not_raw","projection":"remove leading ideographic spaces and tool-link wrappers only"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p011:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：liukun。","source_identity_role":"liukun","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings